The subset, named "Doc KR", is a Modified Version of Pretendard 1.3.9
(https://github.com/orioncactus/pretendard) restricted to the KS X 1001 range.
Because it is a Modified Version and is not Functionally Equivalent to the
Original Version, it does not use any of the Reserved Font Names below.

